                <head>Appendix 116</head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Draft Resolution From the
                        Communications Section Regarding Control of Traffic on Danube</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Draft Resolution Adopted by the
                        Communications Section at Their Special Meeting of April</hi> 26, <hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">and Submitted to the Supreme Economic
                    Council</hi></p>
                <p>It is important that the navigation of the Danube should be placed entirely under
                    one authority to be appointed by the High Command.</p>
                <p>This authority should be charged specially to organise, to the utmost possible
                    extent, the reopening of normal traffic conditions on the Danube.</p>
                <p>In order to save time, the Communications Section should communicate directly
                    with this authority on economic subjects respecting the Danube, provided that
                    copies of such communications are at the same time sent to the High Command.</p>
            </div>
